Files: vendor/*
Copyright: the authors of the Rust crates in vendor/crates, see the
 Cargo.toml and the license files of each crate
License: Apache-2.0 and BSD-2-Clause and BSD-3-Clause and BSL-1.0 and CC0-1.0 and ISC and MIT and MIT-0 and MPL-2.0 and Unicode-3.0 and Unlicense and Zlib and 0BSD
Comment: The Rust crates that gpclient and gpauth link (scripts/vendor-crates.sh;
 not present in a source tree that was not vendored). This is the union of the
 SPDX IDs of the crates linked on Linux; many crates give a choice (for
 example "MIT OR Apache-2.0"). The list of every crate with its license
 expression and the full license and notice texts is the file
 /usr/share/doc/network-manager-gpclient/third-party-licenses.txt
 (scripts/third_party_licenses.py). Also in that file: the crates that have no
 license file in their package.

